msgctxt "MEDIA3/ARC/DAY/DAY_KAB0303.ARC/TALK_ST_KAB0303.BIN::line:316_0_5"
msgid "I see,{PA:10} I see.{PA:20} Then we'll just have to offer||you some motivation!{PA:20}"
